      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"kd-moe-tren-mixture-36l-tu-fine-tune-teacher-en-student\">KD-MoE tr\u00ean Mixture-36l: t\u1eeb fine-tune teacher \u0111\u1ebfn student</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau: nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n <strong>36 l\u1edbp nhi\u1ec5u</strong> trong t\u00edn hi\u1ec7u nhi\u1ec5u + ti\u1ebfng n\u00f3i \u1edf 6 m\u1ee9c SNR (\u22125\u202620 dB) b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t student nh\u1ecf (KD-MoE, 1\u201314M tham s\u1ed1) h\u1ecdc t\u1eeb m\u1ed9t teacher l\u1edbn (BEATs 90M).</span>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Giai \u0111o\u1ea1n</th>\n<th>Vi\u1ec7c</th>\n<th>\u0110\u1ea7u ra</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1. D\u1eef li\u1ec7u</td>\n<td>t\u1ea3i Mixture-36l, AudioSet-40l, VLSP-100h t\u1eeb Kaggle</td>\n<td>th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c dataset</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. Pretrain</td>\n<td>FRCRN (Drive) + BEATs thu\u1ea7n (HuggingFace)</td>\n<td>hai model \u0111\u00f3ng b\u0103ng</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. Fine-tune FRCRN</td>\n<td>h\u1ecdc t\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec5u tr\u00ean Mixture-36l</td>\n<td><code>frcrn/best.pt</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. Fine-tune BEATs</td>\n<td>ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i 36 l\u1edbp tr\u00ean \u0111\u1ea7u ra FRCRN</td>\n<td><code>beats/best.pt</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. Teacher p_t</td>\n<td>embedding BEATs + linear probe cross-fit</td>\n<td><code>teacher_{split}.npz</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6. Student KD-MoE</td>\n<td>ch\u01b0ng c\u1ea5t p_t, 2 stage</td>\n<td><code>stage{1,2}/best.pt</code>, 9 metrics</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">M\u1ecdi giai \u0111o\u1ea1n c\u00f3 <strong>resume + sao l\u01b0u Drive</strong>, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 b\u1eb1ng <strong>9 metrics</strong>: top1, top3, balanced accuracy, precision macro, recall macro, macro F1, micro F1, mAP, macro AUC.</span></span><marimo-mermaid data-diagram='&quot;&#92;nflowchart LR&#92;n    D[&#92;&quot;D\u1eef li\u1ec7u&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003eMixture-36l / AudioSet-40l / VLSP&#92;&quot;] --&#92;u003e P[&#92;&quot;Pretrain&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003eFRCRN + BEATs&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    P --&#92;u003e F1[&#92;&quot;Fine-tune FRCRN&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003et\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec5u&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    F1 --&#92;u003e F2[&#92;&quot;Fine-tune BEATs&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003emask b\u1eb1ng FRCRN&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    F2 --&#92;u003e T[&#92;&quot;Teacher p_t&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003eembedding + probe cross-fit&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    T --&#92;u003e S[&#92;&quot;Student KD-MoE&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003estage 1 \u2192 stage 2&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    S --&#92;u003e E[&#92;&quot;\u0110\u00e1nh gi\u00e1&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003e9 metrics&#92;&quot;]&#92;n&quot;'></marimo-mermaid></div>"
          }
        }
      ],
