          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"1-du-lieu\">1. D\u1eef li\u1ec7u</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Mixture-36l</strong>: mixture = ti\u1ebfng n\u00f3i + nhi\u1ec5u, nh\u00e3n \u0111\u01a1n l\u1edbp (36 l\u1edbp nhi\u1ec5u), 6 m\u1ee9c SNR \u00d7 5040 m\u1eabu train; chia s\u1eb5n <code>train / validation / test</code> (30 240 / 6 480 / 6 480). M\u1ed7i clip 4 s, 16 kHz. C\u00f3 k\u00e8m <code>noise</code> (nhi\u1ec5u thu\u1ea7n) \u0111\u1ec3 hu\u1ea5n luy\u1ec7n FRCRN.</li>\n<li><strong>AudioSet-40l</strong>: nhi\u1ec5u thu\u1ea7n 40 l\u1edbp (multi-hot), clip 10 s. D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00ednh <strong>RMS chu\u1ea9n r</strong> (trung v\u1ecb RMS nhi\u1ec5u thu\u1ea7n) cho b\u01b0\u1edbc teacher.</li>\n<li><strong>VLSP-100h</strong>: ti\u1ebfng n\u00f3i thu\u1ea7n, split c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh theo hash \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn.</li>\n<li>T\u1ea3i b\u1eb1ng token Kaggle, c\u00f3 resume <code>.part</code>; \u0111\u00e3 gi\u1ea3i n\u00e9n th\u00ec b\u1ecf qua. Root dataset \u0111\u1ecdc t\u1eeb bi\u1ebfn m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng <code>MLNC_*</code> ho\u1eb7c <code>config/url.yaml</code>.</li>\n</ul></span><marimo-mermaid data-diagram='&quot;&#92;nflowchart LR&#92;n    K[&#92;&quot;Kaggle API&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003ezip, resume .part&#92;&quot;] --&#92;u003e Z[&#92;&quot;Gi\u1ea3i n\u00e9n&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    Z --&#92;u003e M[&#92;&quot;Mixture-36l&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003emixture + noise + nh\u00e3n 36&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    Z --&#92;u003e A[&#92;&quot;AudioSet-40l&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003enhi\u1ec5u thu\u1ea7n 40 l\u1edbp&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    Z --&#92;u003e V[&#92;&quot;VLSP-100h&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003eti\u1ebfng n\u00f3i thu\u1ea7n&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    M --&#92;u003e TR[&#92;&quot;train 30 240 / val 6 480 / test 6 480&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    A --&#92;u003e R[&#92;&quot;RMS chu\u1ea9n r&#92;&quot;]&#92;n&quot;'></marimo-mermaid></div>"
          }
