            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"3-fine-tune-frcrn-tren-mixture-36l\">3. Fine-tune FRCRN tr\u00ean Mixture-36l</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac FRCRN</strong>: STFT (c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 640, b\u01b0\u1edbc 320, 321 bin) \u2192 <strong>2 UNet x\u1ebfp t\u1ea7ng</strong> (128 k\u00eanh, FSMN b\u1eadc 20) \u2192 m\u1eb7t n\u1ea1 ph\u1ee9c <strong>cIRM</strong> <code>tanh(u1) + tanh(u2(u1))</code> \u2192 iSTFT \u2192 \u01b0\u1edbc l\u01b0\u1ee3ng nhi\u1ec5u <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\hat n||)</marimo-tex>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Hu\u1ea5n luy\u1ec7n</strong>: <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\hat n = \\mathrm{FRCRN}(x)||)</marimo-tex>, \u0111\u00edch l\u00e0 nhi\u1ec5u th\u1eadt <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(n||)</marimo-tex> \u0111i k\u00e8m mixture; m\u1ea5t m\u00e1t SI-SNR. \u0110o\u1ea1n train 2 s, \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 4 s, Adam lr <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(10^{-4}||)</marimo-tex>, grad-clip 10, <strong>gi\u1ea3m n\u1eeda lr</strong> khi 3 epoch kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n (n\u1ea1p l\u1ea1i best), t\u1ed1i \u0111a 40 epoch, patience 15. Ti\u00eau ch\u00ed ch\u1ecdn: <code>noise_si_snr</code> tr\u00ean validation. C\u00f3 resume m\u1ed7i epoch + <code>best.pt</code>/<code>result.json</code> sao l\u01b0u Drive.</span></span><marimo-mermaid data-diagram='&quot;&#92;nflowchart LR&#92;n    X[&#92;&quot;mixture x&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003e2 s&#92;&quot;] --&#92;u003e ST[&#92;&quot;STFT&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    ST --&#92;u003e U1[&#92;&quot;UNet 1&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003eFSMN&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    U1 --&#92;u003e U2[&#92;&quot;UNet 2&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003eFSMN&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    U2 --&#92;u003e MK[&#92;&quot;mask cIRM&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    MK --&#92;u003e IS[&#92;&quot;iSTFT&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    IS --&#92;u003e NH[&#92;&quot;\u01b0\u1edbc l\u01b0\u1ee3ng nhi\u1ec5u n_hat&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    N[&#92;&quot;nhi\u1ec5u th\u1eadt n&#92;&quot;] --&#92;u003e L[&#92;&quot;loss SI-SNR&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    NH --&#92;u003e L&#92;n    L --&#92;u003e OPT[&#92;&quot;Adam, lr 1e-4&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003ehalve lr khi stale&#92;&quot;]&#92;n&quot;'></marimo-mermaid></div>"
