            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"4-fine-tune-beats-voi-mask-frcrn-kich-ban-all-mask\">4. Fine-tune BEATs v\u1edbi mask FRCRN (k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n <code>all + mask</code>)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Lu\u1ed3ng</strong>: <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(x \\rightarrow||)</marimo-tex> FRCRN (\u0111\u00f3ng b\u0103ng) <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\rightarrow \\hat n \\rightarrow||)</marimo-tex> Fbank 128 mel \u2192 <strong>BEATs</strong> (patch 16\u00d716, 12 l\u1edbp, 12 head, dim 768, 192 patch/clip 4 s) \u2192 mean-pool \u2192 Linear \u2192 36 logit.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Hu\u1ea5n luy\u1ec7n</strong>: fine-tune <strong>to\u00e0n b\u1ed9</strong> BEATs (90M tham s\u1ed1), cross-entropy, AdamW lr <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(5\\cdot10^{-5}||)</marimo-tex>, weight-decay 0.01, betas (0.9, 0.98), cosine + warmup 10%, batch 32, t\u1ed1i \u0111a 100 epoch, patience 15, ch\u1ecdn theo <code>macro_f1</code>. M\u1ed7i epoch validation \u0111\u1ee7 9 metrics; cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 test + ma tr\u1eadn nh\u1ea7m l\u1eabn.</span></span><marimo-mermaid data-diagram='&quot;&#92;nflowchart LR&#92;n    X[&#92;&quot;mixture x&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003e4 s&#92;&quot;] --&#92;u003e FR[&#92;&quot;FRCRN&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003e\u0111\u00f3ng b\u0103ng&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    FR --&#92;u003e NH[&#92;&quot;n_hat&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    NH --&#92;u003e FB[&#92;&quot;Fbank&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003e128 mel \u00d7 398&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    FB --&#92;u003e PE[&#92;&quot;PatchEmbed 16x16&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003e192 patch&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    PE --&#92;u003e EN[&#92;&quot;Encoder 12 l\u1edbp&#92;u003cbr/&#92;u003edim 768&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    EN --&#92;u003e MP[&#92;&quot;mean-pool&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    MP --&#92;u003e HD[&#92;&quot;Linear 36&#92;&quot;]